#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLineEdit, c_executable_path)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:62 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:86
msgid "Path to MPlayer executable, either absolute path or a name to look for in the current environment path."
msgstr "Padd na't Programm \"MPlayer\", afsoluut oder en Sööknaam binnen den aktuellen Ümgevenpadd."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_command_line)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLineEdit, c_command_line)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:105 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:129
msgid "Additional options that will be passed to MPlayer on the command line. See mplayer(1) manpage for a complete list of possible options. You can also choose this option for individual file or URL in File Properties."
msgstr "Anner Optschonen, de MPlayer op de Befehlsreeg övergeven warrt. De List mit all Optschonen gifft dat op de (1)-man-Siet för mplayer. Binnen de Datei-Egenschappen lett sik disse Optschoon ok för enkelte Dateien oder URLs fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_demuxer)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:138
msgid "Preferred &demuxer"
msgstr "Vörtrocken &Demuxer"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, l_demuxer)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, c_demuxer)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:147 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:168
msgid "Preferred demultiplexer for handling file formats"
msgstr "Vörtrocken Demuxer för't Verarbeiden vun disse Dateiformaten"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_demuxer)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_demuxer)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:150 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:171
msgid "Property that shows and allows you to change the demultiplexer that should be used to handle file formats. If the chosen demuxer fails on a particular file, another one may be used."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du den Demuxer, de för disse Dateiformaten bruukt warrt, ankieken un wesseln. Funkscheneert de utsöchte Demuxer bi en Datei nich, mag en anner bruukt warrn."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_frame_drop)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_frame_drop)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:190 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:203
msgid "If your system is too slow to play a file, MPlayer can drop some frames so playback does not slow down. None disables dropping, Soft drops less frames, and Hard drops more frames and may sometimes break decoding. You can also choose this option for individual file or URL in File Properties."
msgstr "Is Dien Reekner to langsam för en Datei, kann MPlayer en poor Biller utlaten, denn warrt dat Afspelen nich langsamer. Bi \"Keen\" warrt disse Funkschoon utmaakt, bi \"Week\" warrt minn un bi \"Hart\" mehr Biller utlaten, wat ok to Afbröök bi't Dekoderen föhren mag. Binnen de Datei-Egenschappen lett sik disse Optschoon ok för enkelte Dateien oder URLs fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_use_cache)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_use_cache)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLineEdit, c_cache_size)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_cache_size_kb)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:237 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:250
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:292 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:316
msgid "Option to choose whether to use cache and set its size. Auto lets MPlayer use the its own configuration, None tells MPlayer to use no cache, and Set Size lets you set a specific size. You can also choose this option for individual file or URL in File Properties."
msgstr "Optschoon, mit de Du fastleggen kannst, wat en Twischenspieker bruukt warrt un wo groot he wesen schall. Bi \"Keen\" bruukt MPlayer keen Twischenspieker, bi \"Setten\" een mit de angeven Grött. Binnen de Datei-Egenschappen lett sik disse Optschoon ok för enkelte Dateien oder URLs fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_build_index)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, c_build_index)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:338 kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:351
msgid "Option to choose whether to build new index for seeking. Yes builds an index if the file does not have it, No tells MPlayer not to build index, and Force makes it always build an index. You can also choose this option for individual file or URL in File Properties."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du fastleggen, wat Du en nieg Index för't Söken opstellen wullt. Bi \"Jo\" warrt een opstellt, wenn dat nich al en gifft, mit \"Nee\" kannst Du dat Opstellen verhöden un bi \"Verdwingen\" warrt jümmers en opstellt. Binnen de Datei-Egenschappen lett sik disse Optschoon ok för enkelte Dateien oder URLs fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, c_use_temporary_file)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsadvanced.ui:375
msgid "&Use temporary file for playing from KIOSlave"
msgstr "Temporeerdatei för't Afspelen mit In-/Utgaavmoduul br&uken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, c_use_temporary_file)
