#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, c_shift)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:42
msgid "&Remember for current file any changes made with Shift"
msgstr "All mit Ümschalttast maakt Ännern för aktuelle Datei &wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, c_shift)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:45
msgid "Remember changes made while holding the Shift key down in the file properties for the current file"
msgstr "De Ännern, de Du mit daalhollen Ümschalttast maakst, binnen de Dateiegenschappen vun de aktuelle Datei wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, c_shift)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:48
msgid "Option to choose whether to automatically remember any changes and adjustments made while holding the Shift key down in the file properties for the currently loaded file. This is particularly useful with volume, contrast, brightness and aspect settings, but also works with other options listed (but not checked) below."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du fastleggen, wat all Instellen, de du maakst un dor de Ümschalttast bi daalhöllst, binnen de Dateiegenschappen för de opstunns laadte Datei wohrt warrt. Dit is besünners goot bi Luutstärk, Kontrast, Helligkeit un Bildproportschoon, man funkscheneert ok bi de nerrn wiesten, nich anmaakten Optschonen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, l_remember)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:75
msgid "Always remember the following settings for each file"
msgstr "Disse Instellen jümmers för elk Datei wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, l_remember)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:78
msgid "Always remember any changes made to the settings selected below in the file properties for the current file"
msgstr "Jümmers all Ännern an de nerrn utsöchten Instellen binnen de Dateiegenschappen vun de jüst aktuelle Datei wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, l_remember)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:81
msgid "Option to choose whether to automatically remember any changes and adjustments made to the settings you select below in the file properties for the currently loaded file. The selected settings will be stored even if you do not hold Shift. This is most useful for settings that are almost always file specific, like subtitle URL, subtitle delay, and audio delay."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du fastleggen, wat all Ännern un Topassen an de nerrn utsöchten Instellen binnen de Dateiegenschappen vun de jüst aktuelle Datei wohrt warrt. De utsöchten Instellen warrt ok denn wohrt, wenn Du de Ümschalttast nich daalhöllst. Dit is goot bi Instellen, de meist jümmers bloots för disse Datei gellt, so as Ünnertitel-URL un -Töövtiet oder de Klangpaus."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, c_size)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:121
msgid "Display si&ze"
msgstr "Wies&grött"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, c_size)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:124
msgid "Remember the display size you choose by resizing KPlayer window in the file properties for the current file"
msgstr "De Wiesgrött, de Du utsöchst, wenn Du dat KPlayer-Finster topasst, binnen de Dateiegenschappen vun de aktuelle Datei wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, c_size)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:127
msgid "Option to choose whether to automatically remember the video display size you choose by resizing the KPlayer window in the file properties for the currently loaded file. If this option is not selected, you can still make KPlayer remember the display size by holding down Shift key before and while you resize the window."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du fastleggen, wat Du de Wiesgrött, de Du utsöchst, wenn Du dat KPlayer-Finster topasst, binnen de Dateiegenschappen vun de opstunns laadte Datei wohren wullt. Is dit nich anmaakt, kannst Du KPlayer liekers anwiesen, dat he de Wiesgrött wohren schall, wenn Du bi't Topassen vun't Finster de Ümschalttast daalhöllst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, c_aspect)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:134
msgid "Displa&y aspect"
msgstr "Wiesrebeet-&Proportschoon"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, c_aspect)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:137
msgid "Remember the chosen video aspect in the file properties for the current file"
msgstr "De utsöchte Proportschoon vun't Wiesrebeet binnen de aktuelle Datei ehr Egenschappen wohren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, c_aspect)
#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingscontrols.ui:140
msgid "Option to choose whether to automatically remember the video aspect you choose by using commands on View menu in the file properties for the currently loaded file. If this option is selected, KPlayer will remember the video aspect in the current file's properties, then automatically reset it to the previous setting when another file is loaded. If this option is not selected, you can still make KPlayer remember the video aspect by holding down the Shift key when choosing an aspect command."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du fastleggen, wat Du dat Wiesrebeet sien Proportschoon, de Du mit de Befehlen ut dat Menü \"Ansicht\" utsöcht hest, automaatsch binnen de Egenschappen vun de opstunns laadte Datei wohren wullt. Is dit nich anmaakt, kannst Du KPlayer liekers anwiesen, dat he de Proportschoon wohren schall, wenn Du bi't Bruken vun en Proportschoon-Befehl de Ümschalttast daalhöllst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, c_full_screen)
